  "description": "So-Hwa, a goblin living in an old library. Yun-Woo, who is in love with So-Hwa, makes a contract to share his soul in order to be with her. Repeated reincarnations, an uncontrollable and mismatched relationship. Will Yun-Woo and So-Hwa be able to love again?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
